1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,455
When a new Tesla is sold, Tesla keeps about 1.95 million won

2
00:00:04,475 --> 00:00:08,149
A year ago it was 4.3 million, less than half now

3
00:00:08,169 --> 00:00:13,487
Yet the company is worth about 1,950 trillion won at the Oct 23 close

4
00:00:13,507 --> 00:00:18,091
Why such a price for a carmaker keeping a smartphone's worth per car?

5
00:00:18,111 --> 00:00:21,744
The answer is spending. It keeps 1.95 million won per car,

6
00:00:21,764 --> 00:00:25,269
but spends about 7.5 million won per car on R&D

7
00:00:25,289 --> 00:00:29,718
That money goes to FSD, robotaxis and the Optimus robot

8
00:00:29,738 --> 00:00:33,784
The market is betting these succeed big

9
00:00:33,804 --> 00:00:38,088
How big must they get to justify the price? Check the full video

